@server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5142
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@eventId = 1

### Join Waiting Queue
POST {{server_HostAddress}}/api/queue/{{eventId}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Check Queue Status
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/queue/{{eventId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Leave Waiting Queue
DELETE {{server_HostAddress}}/api/queue/{{eventId}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
